Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 20:39:55 -0400
Subject: media: linlon: add missing VIDEOBUF2_DMA_SG and VIDEOBUF2_MEMOPS
 dependencies (2/2)

Forward-port of meta-cix 7.1 patch
0031-media-linlon-add-missing-VIDEOBUF2_DMA_SG-and-VIDEOB.patch.

VIDEO_LINLON uses vb2_dma_sg_plane_desc() and vb2_dma_sg_memops from
the videobuf2-dma-sg module, but the v7.1 Kconfig entry didn't select
the required symbols. This caused build failures when VIDEOBUF2_DMA_SG
wasn't already enabled by another driver.

Add "select VIDEOBUF2_DMA_SG" and "select VIDEOBUF2_MEMOPS" to fix
the dependency chain on 7.2 too. Without this, defconfig builds that
have VIDEO_LINLON=m but no other consumer of videobuf2-dma-sg fail
with undefined references at module link time.
---
 drivers/media/platform/cix/Kconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/cix/Kconfig b/drivers/media/platform/cix/Kconfig
index 111111111111..222222222222 100755
--- a/drivers/media/platform/cix/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/cix/Kconfig
@@ -2,6 +2,8 @@
 config VIDEO_LINLON
 	tristate "Linlon VPU support"
 	depends on VIDEO_DEV
+	select VIDEOBUF2_DMA_SG
+	select VIDEOBUF2_MEMOPS
 	default y
 	help
 	  This enables support for the Linlon VPU family.
-- 
